{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>תחת</b> — on account of \"the earth trembles\" (רגז הארץ), an allusion to the common people (עם הארץ)."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra reads תחת שלש רגזה ארץ (Prov. 30:21–22) as connecting תחת with רגז הארץ, and plays on the idiom עם הארץ as both 'common people' and 'people of the land/earth.'"}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:25:37.592065741Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}